This software uses the OpenAL Soft library with a renamed dynamic link library to that of OpenAL32 without any other modifications,
and should not be confused with the version that is available from https://www.openal.org/.

These were built using Visual Studio 2019/2022 and the vcpkg package manager from https://vcpkg.io/en/. And at the time of building
were at version 1.24.2.

The sources are avialable from https://github.com/kcat/openal-soft
See http://kcat.strangesoft.net/openal.html for details.

